From 59fe9d3cf91b7c40f8f785f02962231000a3c0e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emergi Idan <idan.emergi@intel.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Feb 2020 17:20:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] LMTSYS-6759: ppv4 reassembly uc gets stuck

Enable reassembly in PPv4
Add additional UC debug capabilities

Signed-off-by: Emergi Idan <idan.emergi@intel.com>
